Running coder: qwen2.5-coder:7b
```python
def reverse_delete(s: str, c: str) -> tuple:
    if not s or not c:
        return ('', False)
    
    result = ''.join(char for char in s if char not in c)
    
    return (result, result == result[::-1])
```
